description="#9's sampler, wired to the source: design/xschem/sampler_core.sch's ro_array_core plus two sampler_dff instances (raw_bit/raw_valid), on a fixed external sample clock. Pin order MUST track design/xschem/sampler_core.sch's own .subckt signature exactly: en1 en2 vddr1 vddr2 vdd vss clk rst_n raw_bit raw_valid -- see design/sampler_core.spice. Instantiated by trng_top.sch (#27) as the analog half of the top-level assembly; raw_bit/raw_valid is the DR-0001 raw tap and the DR-0009 analog/digital verification-level boundary."
}
